  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Profiling, Needs and Intentions of Beneficiaries of Temporary Protection from Ukraine in Sweden - Follow-up Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the improvement of migration management and service provision systems in Sweden, at the request of the Swedish Ministry of Justice, IOM proposes a follow-up study to the rapid profiling survey amongst a sample of the Ukrainian refugees and third-country nationals (TCNs) present in Sweden.  The survey will collect data on the specific needs of Ukrainians, including on the population&apos;s backgrounds, skills, intentions, perspectives, access to services, challenges, vulnerabilities, and protection risks. The survey will also gather information on past activities in Ukraine and their current prospects of work and integration in the Swedish context. Results will be then compared in the analysis with those obtained in the 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
